# Spoken lines in battle: heroes and the masters of the acts. Each is voiced: assets/voice/<lang>/<key>.wav
# start — a fight begins, kill — finished an enemy, hurt — a heavy blow, down — fell, raise — raised, win — victory.
# Masters: start — a fight begins, phase2 — the second guise, death — perishing.

bark-bogatyr-start = Come on, filth. One at a time.
bark-bogatyr-kill = Stay down.
bark-bogatyr-hurt = Nothing. A scratch.
bark-bogatyr-down = Mother earth… take me…
bark-bogatyr-raise = Too soon to bury me.
bark-bogatyr-win = Bring the next ones.

bark-vorozheya-start = The cards fell badly. Worse for you.
bark-vorozheya-kill = I saw this yesterday.
bark-vorozheya-hurt = Why, you… carrion.
bark-vorozheya-down = The thread… is cut…
bark-vorozheya-raise = The thread is tied again.
bark-vorozheya-win = Just as the cards said.

bark-volhv-start = The gods are watching. Do not shame them.
bark-volhv-kill = Go to Chernobog.
bark-volhv-hurt = The flesh is weak. The spirit is not.
bark-volhv-down = Perun… bear witness…
bark-volhv-raise = Not all has been said yet.
bark-volhv-win = We will hold the wake later.

bark-volkolak-start = I smell meat.
bark-volkolak-kill = Sweet.
bark-volkolak-hurt = You bite? So do I.
bark-volkolak-down = The moon… goes out…
bark-volkolak-raise = The beast does not die so easily.
bark-volkolak-win = More. I want more.

bark-znaharka-start = Now then, let me see what ails you.
bark-znaharka-kill = There is no cure for that.
bark-znaharka-hurt = Oh, mercy…
bark-znaharka-down = Herbs… if I had my herbs…
bark-znaharka-raise = You nursed me back, my dears.
bark-znaharka-win = Bandage up while you are still warm.

bark-skomoroh-start = Most honoured audience! We begin!
bark-skomoroh-kill = Take a bow! Curtain!
bark-skomoroh-hurt = Ow! Not funny!
bark-skomoroh-down = The joke… fell flat…
bark-skomoroh-raise = Here I am! Did you miss me?
bark-skomoroh-win = Bravo! Encore! More monsters!

bark-leshy-start = Who walks my forest without asking?
bark-leshy-phase2 = The forest is older than you. The forest is hungrier than you.
bark-leshy-death = The roots… remember…

bark-bolotnik-start = Drowning… all of you, drowning…
bark-bolotnik-phase2 = The bog does not let go. The bog pulls you down.
bark-bolotnik-death = The water… draining…

bark-mara-start = Winter has come for you.
bark-mara-phase2 = You are already frozen. You just do not know it yet.
bark-mara-death = Spring… cursed spring…

bark-koschei-start = Ah, there you are. I have laid the table.
bark-koschei-phase2 = I have no death. You do.
bark-koschei-death = At last.
